§ `s 15(6)-(7), s 23, s 25, s 28 -- days and dates`

#ASSERT `a day has already occurred when the permission is varied or revoked` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 2 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `a day has already occurred when the permission is varied or revoked` (Date 2 6 2026) (Date 2 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `a day has already occurred when the permission is varied or revoked` (Date 3 6 2026) (Date 2 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 20 days payable, 12 not yet occurred, the permission varied to 15: 5 days exceed, all among those not yet occurred
#ASSERT `the number of days removed from the determination on a variation` 20 12 15 EQUALS 5
-- the permission varied to 25, which is more than the 20 days payable: none exceed
#ASSERT `the number of days removed from the determination on a variation` 20 12 25 EQUALS 0
-- the permission varied to 20, equal to the days payable: none exceed
#ASSERT `the number of days removed from the determination on a variation` 20 12 20 EQUALS 0
-- 30 days payable, 4 not yet occurred, the permission varied to 10: 20 exceed, but only 4 have not yet occurred
#ASSERT `the number of days removed from the determination on a variation` 30 4 10 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the day a payability determination comes into force` (Date 10 6 2026) EQUALS Date 10 6 2026
#ASSERT `the day an initial eligibility determination comes into force` (Date 10 6 2026) EQUALS Date 10 6 2026
#ASSERT `the day a revocation is taken to come into force` (Date 9 6 2026) EQUALS Date 9 6 2026
-- the request is made before the last day of the instalment period (10 June 2026): the day before, the day itself, the day after
#ASSERT `a request to revoke is made before the last day of the instalment period` (Date 9 6 2026) (Date 10 6 2026)
#ASSERT NOT `a request to revoke is made before the last day of the instalment period` (Date 10 6 2026) (Date 10 6 2026)
#ASSERT NOT `a request to revoke is made before the last day of the instalment period` (Date 11 6 2026) (Date 10 6 2026)

