§ `s 31A -- the newly arrived resident's waiting period`

-- 104 weeks is 728 days: the day before, the day itself, the day after
#ASSERT NOT `a newly arrived resident's waiting period has ended` 727
#ASSERT `a newly arrived resident's waiting period has ended` 728
#ASSERT `a newly arrived resident's waiting period has ended` 729
-- subsection (4): the later of first entering Australia and becoming the holder of a permanent visa
#ASSERT `the day a newly arrived resident's waiting period starts under subsection (4)` (Date 1 1 2020) (Date 1 3 2020) EQUALS Date 1 3 2020
#ASSERT `the day a newly arrived resident's waiting period starts under subsection (4)` (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 1 1 2020) EQUALS Date 1 3 2020
#ASSERT `the day a newly arrived resident's waiting period starts under subsection (4)` (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 1 3 2020) EQUALS Date 1 3 2020
-- a day is in the waiting period from the start day until 728 days have been spent in Australia after it
#ASSERT NOT `a day is in a newly arrived resident's waiting period` (Date 29 2 2020) (Date 1 3 2020) 0
#ASSERT `a day is in a newly arrived resident's waiting period` (Date 1 3 2020) (Date 1 3 2020) 0
#ASSERT `a day is in a newly arrived resident's waiting period` (Date 1 3 2022) (Date 1 3 2020) 727
#ASSERT NOT `a day is in a newly arrived resident's waiting period` (Date 2 3 2022) (Date 1 3 2020) 728
