#ASSERT `the index number of the base December quarter` 2021 `the invented December quarter index numbers` EQUALS 110
#ASSERT `the index number of the base December quarter` 2020 `the invented December quarter index numbers` EQUALS 110
-- the December quarter 2007 is the earliest that can be the base: 2008 as the reference quarter has only 2007 before it
#ASSERT `the index number of the base December quarter` 2008 `the invented December quarter index numbers` EQUALS 100
